  id: Scene11_FAQ_2
  speaker: WATTSON
  text: "Two quantities are directly proportional when doubling one doubles the other,
    tripling one triples the other, and so on. Our table shows exactly that: double
    the volts, double the amperes. Scientists write it with the symbol V \u221D I."
